<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">Nehemiah</book>
  <para style="h">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Nehemiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hakaliah ih fapa Nehemiah ih ṭuansuahmi thuanthu cu hiti in a si. Artakzaksis siangpahrang a ṭuan kum kulnak, Kislev thla ah keimah Nehemiah cu Susa khawpi ah ka um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Culai ah ka unau pakhat Hanani cu a rualpi dang pawl thawn Judah ram ihsin an ra thleng; cule Babilon ram saltaannak ihsin Jerusalem ih a kirmi Judah mi pawl thuhla ka sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutiih ka suh tikah, saltaannak in a suak ih an khua le an ram a thlengmi pawl cu harsatnak tampi an tong ih an kiangkap ih ummi miphun dang pawl in an hmuhsuam hai a si tiah in sim. Cuih tlunah Jerusalem kulhnak phar pawl cu an cim thluh ih, an ur thluh hnu in kotka pawl tla cu an tuah sal hrih lo a si, ti tla in sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih thu ka theih tikah ka to ih ka ṭap. Ni tampi sung riahsia in ka um ih zianghman ei loin rawl ka ul. Pathian hnenah thla ka cam ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Maw Bawipa, Van ih Pathian, nang cu na maksak ih kan lo ṭihzah ngaingai. Nang cu rintlak na si ih a lo duhdawtu le na thupekmi a thluntu pawl parah cun na thukam cu na kimter ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maw ka Bawipa, na mit in i run zoh awla Israel mi na siahhlawh pawl hrangah sunzan ih thla ka camnak hi na hna in i run theihsak hram aw. Na parah Israel mi pawl cu kan sual ngaingai zo ih cuih kan sualnak cu ka phuang a si. Ka pupa pawl an rak sual ih keimah tla ka sual a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ṭha lozet le mawi lozetin na hmaiah kan nung a si. Na thupekmi kan tuah lo; na siahhlawh Moses hnen ihsin in pek mi daan pawl cu kan thlun lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asinain Moses hnenah, ‘Nannih Israel mi pawl zumtlak lo nan si ahcun ram dang le miphun dang lakah ka lo ṭhekdarh thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ka hnenah nan kirsal ih ka thupekmi nan thlun a si ahcun, vanrang deng tiang ṭhekdarh thluhmi sikhal uhla, keimah in biaknak dingah ka hril zomi hmun ahcun ka lo kirter sal ding a si,’ tiih na rak timi kha cingkeng hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Maw Bawipa, hi milai pawl hi na siahhlawh an si, nangmah ih minung an si. Na baan thacak le na huham in na runsuak mi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei ka thlacamnak le na hmin upat a lo duhtu na siahhlawh dang pawl ih thlacamnak hi run ngai hram aw. Tuihsun ahhin i hlawhtlingter hram awla Siangpahrang Bawipa cu ka parah zaangfahnak neiter hram aw,” ka ti. Culai ahcun keimah cu siangpahrang bawipa ih sabitti petu ka si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siangpahrang Artakzaksis in siangpahrang a ṭuan kum kulnak, Nisan thla ah, voikhat cu siangpahrang bawipa rawl a ei laiah sabitti cu ka pe. Hi hlan ahcun mithmaisia ih ka um i hmu dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Curuangah, “Ziangah so na riah a siat? Na dam lo a si lo ahcun na lung a dam lo a si hi!” tiah i ti. Cutikah ka thin a phangzet ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Maw Siangpahrang bawipa, na nunkhua sau hram seh. Ka pupa pawl an phumawknak khawpi siatbal thluh in le a kotka pawl ur ciam thluh ih a um laiah hin ziangtinso riahsia lo cun ka um thei ding?” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siangpahrang bawipa cun, “Ziang tuah so na duh?” tiah i sut. Cutikah Van ih Pathian hnenah thla ka cam hnuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />siangpahrang hnenah cun, “Maw siangpahrang bawipa, ka parah na lung a awi ih ka lo dilmi i pe ding a si ahcun Judah ram, ka pupa pawl an rak phumawknak khawpi ah i thlah hram aw; cuih khawpi dinsal ka duh a si,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siangpahrang bawinu cu a kiangah a to ih siangpahrang bawipa cun, “Ziang can so na rei ding? Ziangtikah so na rakir sal thei ding?” tiah i sut. Ka rei ding can cu ka sim ih thlah dingah a lung a kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule siangpahrang hnenah cun, “Bawipa, na lung a kim a si ahcun Judah ram tiang ka feh suak theinak dingah Eufrates Nitlaknak lam pengih ram uktu Mangki bawi pawl hnenah ca i ngan sak hram aw. Judah ram ka thlen hlan lo anmah in tluang tein in fehter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun siangpahrang ih tupi thing pawl kiltu Asaf hnen ihsin Biakinn hauhruang kotka hrang, khawpi kulhnak phar hrang le ka umnak inn hrangah zanthing i pek theinak dingin a hnenah ca i ngan sak hram aw,” tiah ka dil. Mi zaangfahnak neitu Pathian kut cu ka hnenih a um ruangah, ka dilmi hmuahhmuah cu siangpahrang bawipa in i pek ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Siangpahrang bawipa in keimah thlahtu ah ralbawi hrekkhat pawl le rang ralkap pawl a fial ih Eufrates Nitlaknak ram lam ahcun ka feh. Ka thlen tikah cuih peng uktu Mangki bawi pawl hnenah siangpahrang bawipa ih ca cu ka pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Asinain Beth Horon khuami Sanballat le Ammon mi bawi pakhat Tobiah in, Israel mi pawl ṭhatnak le thawvennak ngaihtuah dingah mi pakhat a ra, ti an theih cun thin nuam lo zetin an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun Jerusalem khawpi ah ka va thleng ih ni thum sung ka cawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jerusalem hrang hnaṭuan dingah Pathian in ka thinlung sungih i simmi cu zohman ka sim lo. Cule zanah ka tho ih ka rualpi mi malte thawn kan feh. Zianghman kan keng lo; ka tomi rang pakhat lawng kan keng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nitlaknak lam Phairawn Kotka in ka suak ih thlanglam ah suk in Rulhreng Cerhti ka lan ih Hnawm Kotka ka thlen ah zan a si lai. Ka feh phah ah khawpi kulhnak phar pawl a siatmi pawl le mei ih an ur thluhmi kotka pawl cu ka zoh phah vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun ka so ih Cerhti Kotka le Siangpahrang Tili ka thleng. Ka tomi rang cun a cimmi lung le thing lakah lamzin a hmu thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Curuangah Kidron phairawn sungah ka ṭum ih rang par in phar pawl cu ka zoh phah vivo. Ka pawhnak hmun ka thleng sal ih Phairawn Kotka cun khawpi sungah ka lut sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawi pawl pakhat hmanin khuitawk ka feh ti le ziang ka tuah, ti an thei lo. Judah mi pawl, puithiam pawl, an hotu pawl, an bawi pawl le hnaṭuannak ih a teltu ding pawl pakhat hnen hmanah zianghman ka ṭong hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Atu lawngah an hnenah hiti in ka sim: “Jerusalem khua cu a siat thluh ih kotka pawl tla ur thluh a si ruangah ziangtluk vansaannak sungah so kan um, ti cu nan hmu. Khawpi kulhnak phardawl cu dinsal uhsila kan thangsiatnak hi rehter uhsi,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule Pathian ka hnenih a umzia le i bomnak pawl ka sim ih siangpahrang bawipa ih ṭongmi pawl tla ka sim ṭheh. Cutikah, “Tho uhsila dinsal uhsi,” an ti. An tim an tuah ih hnaṭuan cu an thok lohli.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Sanballat, Tobiah le Arabia mipa Geshem an timi in kan thil tuah tummi cu an theih tikah in hnihsan ih, “Ziang kan tuah, tiah so nan ruah? Siangpahrang kan dodal ding nan ti maw si?” ti tiangin in hmuhsuam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule kei in, “Van ih Pathian in hlawhtlinnak in pe ko ding. Kannih cu a siahhlawh kan si ih a siatmi saksaal ding cu kan ṭuan ko ding. Asinain nannih cu Jerusalem ahhin covo nan nei lo; thu nan nei lo ih ham ding zianghman nan nei lo,” ka ti hai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khawpi kulhnak Phar cu hiti in an dawl sal. Puithiam Sang Eliashib le a unau puithiam pawl in Tuu Kotka timi an rem; an thiangter ih kotka pawl tla an tuah. Phar cu Zakhat donhleisang timi le Hananel donhleisang timi tiang an rem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A sangtu phar cu Jerikho khuami pawl in an rem. A sangtu cu Imri ih fapa Zakkur in a rem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hassenaah hrin in Nga Kotka an tuah. A tlang an ran ih kotka pawl cu an tuah; kotka kharnak ah a hren le a kalh pawl tla an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A sangtu cu Uriah ih fapa, Hakkoz ih tupa, Meremoth in a rem. Berekhiah ih fapa, Meshezabel ih tupa, Meshullam in a sangtu cu a rem. Baana ih fapa Zadok in a sangtu cu a rem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tekoa khuami pawl in a sangtu cu an rem. (Asinain khawsung upa pawl cun hnaṭuan hotu pawl ih hnaṭuan fialmi ṭuan cu an nautat ih an el.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Paseah ih fapa Joiada le Besodeiah ih fapa Meshullam in Jeshanah Kotka an tuah. A tlang an tuah ih kotka pawl an rem hnuah kotka kharnak ah a hren le a kalh pawl an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gibeon mi Melatiah, Meronoth mi Jadon le Gibeon khawsungmi le Mizpah khawsungmi pawl in a sangtu phar cu an dawl ih Eufrates Nitlaknak peng uktu Mangki bawipa ih inn tiang an vun rem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A sangtu cu suisertu Harhaiah ih fapa Uzziel in a rem. A sangtu cu rimhmui tuahtu Hananiah in Phar Kaupi tiang a rem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hur ih fapa Refaiah, Jerusalem peng a hrek uktu pa in a sangtu phar cu a rem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Harumaf ih fapa Jedaiah in a sangtu phar, a inn kiangte, cu a rem. Hashabneiah ih fapa Hattush in a sangtu a rem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Harim ih fapa Malkhijah le Pahath Moab ih fapa Hasshub in a sangtu phar le Lungthu donhleisang timi an rem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hallohesh ih fapa Shallum, Jerusalem peng a hrek uktu bawi in a sangtu a rem. (A fanu pawl in an bawm.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hanun le Zanoah khawsung ummi pawl in Phairawn Kotka an rem. Kotka pawl an tuah sal ih a kharnak ah a hren le a kalh pawl an tuah; phar cu pi thawngkhat le zanga sung Hnawm Kotka tiang an rem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rekhab fapa Malkhijah, Beth Hakkherem peng uktu in Hnawm Kotka cu a rem. Kotka pawl cu a rem ih a kharnak ah a hren le a kalh pawl a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kolhozeh ih fapa Shallum, Mizpah peng uktu in Cerhti Kotka a rem. A tlun a khuh ih kotka pawl a tuah ṭheh hnuah a hren le a kalh pawl tla a tuah. Siangpahrang hmuan a hun sangtu Shelah Tikhur phar cu a rem ih David Khawpi ih vungṭumnak kailawn thlengin a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Azbuk ih fapa Nehemiah, Beth Zur peng a hrek uktu in a sangtu phar cu a rem ih David thlaan, tikhur le ralkap pawl umnak inn tiang a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A tanglam Levi pawl in phar cu an rem: Bani ih fapa Rehum in a sangtu phar cu a rem. Keilah peng hrek uktu Hashabiah in a peng sung ai-awh in a sangtu phar a rem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Henadad ih fapa Bavvai, a dang Keilah peng hrek uktu in a sangtu phar a rem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mizpah uktu, Jeshua fapa Ezer in a sangtu phar, ral hriamhrei tuahnak hmai ihsin phar a keelnak tiang a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zabbai ih fapa Baruk in a sangtu phar cu Puithiam Sang Eliashib inn luhnak sangka tiang a rem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Uriah ih fapa le Hakkoz tusuan Meremoth in a sangtu cu Eliashib inn netnak tiang a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Phar remtu pawl lakah a thuailam puithiam pawl tla an tel a si: Jerusalem khua kiangkap ih puithiam pawl in a sangtu phar cu an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Benjamin le Hasshub in a sangtu phar, an inn hmai zawn an rem fingfing. Maaseiah ih fapa le Ananiah tusuan Azariah in a sangtu, a inn hmai zawn ralden a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Henadad ih fapa Binnui in a sangtu Azariah inn ihsin a kelnak phar kiil tiang a rem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Uzai ih fapa Palal in a sangtu cu phar kiil le Siangpahrang tlunta inn ih innsanghlei, inn kiltu pawl ih inn zawn in a rem. Parosh ih fapa Pedaiah in a sangtu cu a rem ih nisuahnak lamah Tidai Kotka le biakinn kilnak innsang tiang a rem. (Himi cu biakinn saktu pawl umnak Ofel an timi khua kiangte a si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tekao khuami pawl in a sangtu phar cu an rem; an hnaṭuan ṭumhnihnak a si; biakinn kilnak innsanghlei tumpi hmaizawn ihsin Ofel kiangih phar tiang an rem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Puithiam bur khat in a sangtu phar an rem ih Rang Kotka in a saklam ah anmah an inn hmaizawn ciar an rem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Immer ih fapa Zadok in a sangtu, amah ih inn hmaizawn a rem. Nisuahnak lam Kotka kiltu, Shekaniah fapa Shemaiah in a sangtu a rem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Shelemiah fapa Hananiah le Zalaf fapa paruknak Hanun in a sangtu phar cu, a ṭumhnihnak ah an rem. Berekhiah ih fapa Meshullam in a sangtu, amah ih umnak inn hmaizawn a rem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Suisertu Malkhijah in a sangtu phar a rem. A remmi cu saklam nisuahnak lam phar kiil tlunta khaan kiang, biakinn fehnak kotka kiangih ummi, dawr tuahtu le biakinn saktu pawl umnak inn tiang a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Suisertu pawl le dawrtuahtu pawl in a sangtu phar cu phar kiil ih khaan ihsin Tuu Kotka tiang an rem.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kannih Judah mi pawl in Jerusalem kulhnak phar kan rem sal rero kha Sanballat in a theih tikah a ai a thok ih a thin cu tisa so in a so.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A rualpi pawl le Samaria ralkap pawl hmaiah in hmuhsuam ih, “Hi Judah mi ṭawnṭai pawl hi ziang kan tuah ti in so an ruah awk? Khawpi dinsal an tum maw si? Thawinak pawl pe tahrat in ni khat ah kan ṭuan ṭheh ding, tiah an ruat-aw maw si? A cimmi le a kaang ciami hmang tahrat in inn saknak lungto kan tuah thei ding, an ti maw si?” a ti ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ammon mi Tobiah cu a kiangah a um ih anih khal cun, “Ziangvek phar so hipawl cun an dawl thei ding? Cinghnia hman a parah kai sehla a cim thei ding a sisi!” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutikah kei Nehemiah in thla ka cam ih, “Maw Pathian, in hmuhsuam zia hi run thei hram aw. An ṭongsia cu anmah ih lu parah tla hram seh. An neihmi hmuahhmuah lon thluhmi le ramdang ih thawngthlakmi ah cang hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mahte ih phar remtu le tuahtu pawl in hmuhsuam ruangah an ṭhatlonak hi ngaithiam hlah awla, an sualnak hi hngilh hram hlah aw,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuticun phar cu kan song vivo ko ih misenpi pawl hnaṭuan an lawt tuk ruangah a rei hlanah a saanlam ih hrek cu a thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem kulhnak phar kan dawl ih sawtzet in kan tuah thei ih phar ongmi pawl tla kan phit vivo, ti kha Sanballat le Tobiah, Arabia mi pawl, Ammon le Ashdod in an theih tikah an thin a heng ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Curuangah thurual zetin Jerusalem ra do ih hnaihnok ṭheh ko ih tuah dingah a phiar in tum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asinain kan Pathian hnenah thla kan cam ih ralvengtu dingah a sunzan in mi kan ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Culai ah Judah mi pawl ih an sak ṭheu mi hla cu: “Kan ṭuan a khung tukih kan cau deuhdeuh, Hnawm hlon ding a tam hrih fawn; Ziangtin so phar hi kan din thei ding?” ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kan ral pawl cun, “In theih hlan le in hmuh hlanah an hnenah kan thleng ding ih kan that hai ding; cuticun an hnaṭuanmi cu a cawlta ding,” tiah an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule kan ral pawl lakih a ummi Judah mi pawl in ral pawl ih in do tumnak thu pawl cu atu le atu in sim cingcing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Curuangah senpi pawl cu ralnam, feipi le conkiang pawl ka pek ih a hrin a hrin in kan ṭheh hrih lonak phar phen ah ka ṭanter vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule senpi pawl an um a nuam deuh lo ti ka hmuh tikah senpi pawl le an hotu le an bawi pawl cu, “Kan ral pawl cu ṭih hrimhrim hlah uh. Kan Bawipa ziangtluk cak le ṭihnungza a si, ti ciing ringring uhla nan unau pawl, nan faate pawl, nan nupi pawl le nan innsang hrang ruat in do uh,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kan ral pawl in in phiarnak kan theih kha an thei ih an tumtah mi cu Pathian in a phelhsolh zo ti kha an thei. Cuih hnuah kan zatein hnaṭuan cu kan thok sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuihsin thokin ka minung pawl a hrekin hna an ṭuan ih a hrek in feipi, ralphaw, conkiang le thir angki thawn ral an veng. Cule phar a remtu Judah mi pawl cu an hotu pawl in nasa zetin an ṭanpi hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Phar dawlnak thil a phurtu hmuahhmuah in an kut khatlam in an thil an kai ih khatlam in hriamnam an keng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hnaṭuantu hmuahhmuah in an taai ah ralnam an ṭeem fingfing. Poipeng ih tawtawrawt tumtu ding pa cu ka kiangah a um ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Senpi pawl, an hotu le an bawi upa pawl cu, “Kan ṭuan mi hi a kau tukih kan darhdai-awk tuk ruangah pakhat le pakhat hi kan hlat aw tuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tawtawrawt tum nan theih ahcun hmakhatte-ah ka kiangah in ra pan ṭheh uh. Kan Pathian in kan ai-ah a do ding a si,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Curuangah nitinte zing thlapit in zan thlavang tiang, a hrekin hna kan ṭuan ih a hrekin feipi thawn ral kan veng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuih tlunah hnaṭuantu hmuahhmuah le anmah bawmtu hmuahhmuah cu zanah ralveng ding le sunah hnaṭuan dingin Jerusalem khawsung ih riak dingah ka sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keimah le ka rualpi pawl, ka hnen-um pawl le i kiltu pawl thawn kan zatein kan thilthuam khal zanah kan hlit lo. Kan hriamnam kan keng fingfing.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tikcu a rei deuh tikah nunau ti lo mipa ti loin an unau Judah mi ṭhenkhat tlunah lungkim lonak an nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Sungrual kan si ih kan nunnak dingah rawl kan khop lo,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhat in, “Rawl loih thih hnak cun, tiah kan inn kan lo le kan sabit hmuan tiangin kan pawng a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A dang mi ṭhenkhat in, “Kan lo le kan sabit hmuan hrangih ngunkhuai pek dingah tangka kan cawi a ṭul a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judah mi unau pawl hi thiikhat le sakhat kan si; Annih poihai mi le kannih poihai mi hi a bangrep lo maw? An faate cu an hrangih an sunlawi vekin kan faate pawl cu kan hrangah an sunglawi ve lo maw? Asinain kan faate pawl cu salah kan tuah hai a ṭul. Kan fanu hrekkhat pawl cu salah zuar an si zo. Kan titheimi zianghman a um lo, ziangahtile kan lo le kan sabit hmuan pawl cu in long thluh a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutiih an phunzainak ka theih tikah ka thin a heng ngaingai ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />thil pakhatkhat ka tuah a ṭul a si, ka ti. An hotu pawl le an bawi upa pawl cu ka kawk ih an hnenah, “Nan unau pawl parih nan thil tuah mi hi aṭha lo a si,” tiah ka sim. Cule cuih thu rel dingah misenpi ka kokhawm ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />an hnenah, “A can thei nawn lo ruangah miphun dang hnenah a zuar-awmi kan unau Judah mi pawl hman a si thei tawkin kan lei kir sal rero. Culai ah nannih in nan unau pawl cu zuar-aw dingin nan rak hneek rero lehlam,” ka ti. An hotu pawl cu an dai khepkhep ih ṭong ding zianghman an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun, “Nan tuah mi hi thilsual a si! Kan ral pawl, Zentail mi pawl ih hmuhsuam lonak dingah Pathian ṭihzah in a dikmi tuah ding nan si sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mipi pawl kha ka hnen ihsin paisa le rawl ka cawiter hai. Cuvekin ka hnaṭuanpi pawl le ka hnaṭuantu pawl khal in an coih ve. Atu thok ihsin in cawimi pawl cu zohman in kan cawh sal nawn lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Atu rori in an lo, an sabit hmuan, an olif hmuan le an inn pawl cu pek sal ṭheh uh. Tangka maw, fangfai maw, sabitti maw, olif hriak maw, an lo baakmi hmuahhmuah atu ihsin daih thluh uh,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah hotu pawl in, “Na sim vek cun kan tuah thluh ding; an thilri cu kan pek sal ding ih in baakmi cu kan cawh nawn lo ding,” tiah in ti. Cule puithiam pawl ka ko ih an thutiam vekih tuahsuak dingah an hmaiah siat ka camter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka taaiven puan ka phoih ih an hmaiah cun ka thin. “Nan thukam vekih nan tuah lo a si ahcun Pathian in hi taaiven puan vekin a lo thing ding. Pathian in nan inn pawl le nan neihmi hmuahhmuah a lo long ṭheh ding ih nan lawng fangkheh in a lo taan hai ding,” tiah ka ti. Cutawkih a ummi hmuahhmuah in, “Amen,” an ti ih Bawipa an thangṭhat. Cule an thuthiam mi cu an thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Artakzaksis Siangpahrang a ṭuan kum kulnak ihsin kum sawmthum le kum hnihnak tiang, kumpi kum hleihnih, Judah ram uktu Mangki bawi ka si sungah hin keimah siseh ka sungkhat pawl siseh ram uktu bawi ih ei dingmi rawl kan ei dah hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka hlanih ram uktu Mangki bawi a rak ṭuantu pawl cu misenpi hrangah thilrit an rak si ih nitinte an rawl le an zu hrangah ngun tangka sawmli an hmang ringring. An hnen-um pawl tiangin misenpi tisiatu an si. Sikhalsehla kei cu Pathian ka ṭih ruangah cutin ka tuah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka thazaang neihmi hmuahhmuah cu khawpi ralhruang kulhnakah ka hmang ih ka hrangah ziangbangtuk thilri hman ka hawl lo. I riantu ka hnen-um pawl hmuahhmuah khal cuih phar dawl hna an ṭuan thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka rawl einak cabuai ah Judah mi le an hotu pawl za le sawmnga rawl ka eipi ringring ih hlei ah kan kiangkap ram ihsin ka hnenih a ra mi hmuahhmuah ka cawm a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka ei dingah nitinte cawcang pakhat, tuu ṭha bik paruk le ar tampi kan that ringring ih nihra ah voikhat sabitti a thar in ka suah ringring. Cubangtuk a si naón misenpi pawl an zonzai tuk ruangah ram uktu Mangki bawi ih ngah ding timi zat hman ka lo la lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hi tlukin misenpi hrangih ka tuah mi hi Pathian in ka ṭhatnak hrangah i theihsak hram seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sanballat, Tobiah, Geshem le kan ral pawl hmuahhmuah in khawpi ralhruang kan kulh ṭheh ih ralhruang ah ong a um nawn lo, ti an thei. (Kotka umnak tiih kan zuahmi ah kotka kan tuah hrih lo.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Curuangah Sanballat le Geshem in thu in than ih Ono Hmunrawn ih khawte pakhat ih tong-aw dingin in sawm. Himi cu keimah ziangmaw ti ih tuahmawh duh ah in bumnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutikah mi ka thlah ih, “Hnaṭuan thupizet ka neih ruangah ka rung thei lo ding. Nanmah tong dingih kan run ahcun hnaṭuan kan colh thluh a ṭul ding ih ziangti hmanin hnaṭuan cu ka cawlter thei lo,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuvek ṭhiamṭhiam in voi li tiang thu in hun cah. Kei khal in cuti thotho cun ka vun khirh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A voi nganak ah Sanballat in ca a ngan ih erh loin a hnen-um pakhat a hun phurhter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ca sungah cun, “Nangmah le Judah mi pawl cu ral thawh an tum ruangah khawpi ralhruang an rem rero a si, tiah kiangkap mi pawl in an rel rero tiin Geshem in i sim. Cuih tlunah Nehemiah cu amah le amah siangpahrang ah a tuah-aw ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah siangpahrang ah Nehemiah a si, tiah Jerusalem khua ih phuangtu dingah Profet pawl tla a ret thluh zo, tiah in sim fawn. Hi thu cu siangpahrang bawipa in a thei leh thotho ding ih curuangah nangmah le keimah tong-aw in thu ruat tlang sehla ka duh a si,” tiah a ngan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah ca ka khirh ih, “Na sim mi hi pakhat hman a dikmi a um lo. Nangmah ih phuahcop hlir an si,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An zatein kan hnaṭuanmi baang dingah in hro ciamco. Asinain Pathian in i cakter sinsin zo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuih tikcu hrawngah Delaiah ih fapa le Mehetabel ih fasuan Shemaiah cu inn ihsin khui hmanah suakvak thei loih a um ruangah va leng dingin ka feh. Cutikah anih in, “Nangmah le keimah kan feh pei ih Biakinn ah kan relh pei; sangka hmuahhmuah tawh in kan hren thluh pei; ziangahtile nangmah that dingah an ra ding. Zan ah ra in an lo that ding a si,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule kei in, “Kei cu a tlan le a relh ding pawl ka si lo. Ka nunnak hum dingah Biakinn ah a relh ding tiah maw i ruah? Ka relh lo ding,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka ruah sal tikah Pathian in a hnenih thu a sim ruangah a si lo, Tobiah le Sanballat in nawhthuh an pek ruangah hiti ih a ṭongnak cu a si, ti ka vun thei sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka thangsiatnak le ka ningzahter duh ah nawhthuh an pek ih sualnak tuahter duh ah mi an fial a rak si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thla ka cam ih, “Maw Pathian, Tobiah le Sanballat thil timi hi ciingṭha awla hrem hai aw. A thin phang seh tiih i ti rero vetu profet nu Nodiah le a dang profet pawl tla hi ciing ṭha aw,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hnaṭuan cu Elul thla ni kul hluannga ni ah kan ṭheh; a zate-ah ni sawmnga le ni hnih sung kan rei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kan kiangkap ih a ummi kan ral pawl in an theih tikah an mithmai a sia ngaingai; ziangahtile Pathian bomnak in kan tuahsuak kha zozo khal in an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuih caan sung hmuahhmuah ah Judah hotu pawl le Tobiah cu ca an kuat-aw ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tobiah cu Arah ih fapa Shekaniah ih maak-pa a si ruangah Judah ramsung mi tampi cu a lamah an ṭang. Cuih tlunah a fapa Jehohanan in Berekhiah ih fapa Meshullam ih fanu a ṭhit.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi hrekkhat pawl cun Tobiah ih ṭhatnak lawnglawng ka theih hngan ah an rel ih, ka ṭongmi hmuahhmuah cu a hnenah an sim ṭheh. Tobiah cun a thin phang seh tiah ca i kuat ringring.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ralhruang kulh cu kan ṭheh ih kotka pawl kan tuah thluh; biakinn kiltu pawl, hla saktu pawl le Levi mi pawl cu hnaṭuan kan zem ciar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem khua uktu dingah ka unau Hanani le ralhruang kiltu ralbawi Hananiah ka ret. Hananiah cu Pathian ṭihzahtu le rinsan tlakzet, zo hman ih bang lomi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An pahnih in Jerusalem kotka pawl cu nisuah hnu lawngah on dingah le nitlak zawng kotka kiltu pawl hman an tlun hlanah khar ih hren ṭheh dingah ka sim. Jerusalem ih a ummi sungin khua kilvengtu lakih mi hrekkhat a ṭulnak zawn ah ralvengtu ah ret ih mihrek cu anmah ih inn ciar kilveng dingin ret dingah ka sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem khawpi cu a tumzet naón a sungih ummi minung cu an tam lo; inn tla tampi an sak hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian in ka thinlung i thawhter ih misenpi le an bawi pawl le an hotu pawl cu ka kokhawm ih an innsang ciarih mipum cazin ka la. Saltaannak ihsin hmaisa bikih a kirmi pawl ih cazin cu ka tong ih a tanglam vek in a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thuailam pawl cu Judah pengih a ummi, Siangpahrang Nebuchadnezzar in Babilon ah a hruai ih cutawk ihsin ra kir salih Jerusalem le Judah ramsung anmah ih khua ciarih tlung salmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kirpitu upa pawl cu Zerubbabel, Joshua, Nehemiah, Azariah, Raamiah, Nahamani, Mordekai, Bilshan, Mispereth, Bigvai, Nehum le Baanah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sal taannak ihsin a ra kir mi Israel hrin pawl le an hrin ih mipum zat ciar cu hihi an si: Parosh hrin in thawnghnih za sawmsarih le pahnih, Shefatiah hrin in zathum sawmsarih le pahnih, Arah hrin in zaruk sawmnga pahnih, Pahath Moab (Jeshua le Joab tefa sin pawl) in thawnghnih zariat le hleiriat, Elam hrin in thawngkhat zahnih sawmnga le pali, Zattu hrin in zariat sawmli le panga, Zakkai hrin in zasarih le sawmruk, Binnui hrin in zaruk sawmli le pariat, Bebai hrin in zaruk le kul hluanriat, Azgad hrin in thawnghnih zathum le kul hluanhnih, Adonikam hrin in zaruk sawmruk le pasarih, Bigvai hrin in thawnghnih sawmruk le pasarih, Adin hrin in zaruk sawmnga le panga, Ater (Hezekiah) hrin in sawmkua le pariat, Hashum hrin in zathum le kul hluanriat, Bezai hrin in zathum kul hluanli, Harif hrin in za le hleihnih, Gibeon hrin in sawmkua le panga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An pupa pawl a hnuailam khua ah a rak ummi ih tesinfa pawl a kir mi cu hihi an si: Bethlehem le Netofah khuami tesinfa ah za sawmriat le pariat, Anathoth khuami tesinfa ah za le kul hluanriat, Beth Azmaveth khuami tesinfa ah sawmli le pahnih, Kiriath Jearim, Khefirah le Beeroth khuami tesinfa ah zasarih sawmli le pathum, Ramah le Geba khuami tesinfa ah zaruk le kul hluankhat, Mikmas khuami tesinfa ah za le kul hluanhnih, Bethel le Ai khuami tesinfa ah za le kul hluanthum, A dang Nebo khuami tesinfa ah sawmnga le pahnih, A dang Elam khuami tesinfa ah thawngkhat zahnih sawmnga le pali, Harim khuami tesinfa ah zathum le kul, Jerikho khuami tesinfa ah zathum sawmli le panga, Lod, Hadid le Ono khuami tesinfa ah zasarih le kul hluankhat, Senaah khuami tesinfa ah thawngthum zakua le sawmthum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Puithiam pawl hrin sungin a kirmi pawl cu hihi an si: Jedaiah (Jeshua tesinfa) hrin in zakua sawmsarih le pathum, Immer hrin in thawngkhat sawmnga le pahnih, Pashhur hrin in thawngkhat zahnih sawmli le pasarih, Harim hrin in thawngkhat le hleisarih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Levi mi hrin in a kirmi pawl cu hihi an si: Jeshua le Kadmiel hrin (Hodaviah tesinfa) in sawmsarih le pali,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Biakinn hla satu pawl (Asaf tesinfa) in za sawmli le pariat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Biakinn kiltu pawl (Shallum, Ater, Talmon, Akkub, Hatita le Shobai tesinfa) in za sawmthum le pariat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Biakinn saktu pawl an hrin ciar thawn a kirmi pawl cu hihi an si: Ziha, Hasufa, Tabbaoth, Keros, Sia, Padon, Lebana, Hagaba, Shalmai, Hanan, Giddel, Gahar, Reaiah, Rezin, Nekoda, Gazzam, Uzza, Paseah, Besai, Meunim, Nefusesim, Bakbuk, Hakufa, Harhur, Bazlith, Mehida, Harsha, Barkos, Sisera, Temah, Neziah le Hatifa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Solomon hnen-um pawl, an hrin ciar thawn a kirmi pawl cu hihi an si: Sotai, Sofereth, Perida, Jaalah, Darkon, Giddel, Shefatiah, Hattil, Pokhereth, Hazzebaim le Amon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Biakinn saktu pawl le Solomon hnen-um pawl, a kirmi ih tesinfa cu an zatein zathum sawmkua le pahnih an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tel Melah khua, Tel Harsha khua, Kherub khua, Addon khua le Immer khua in Delaiah hrin, Tobiah hrin le Nekoda hrin, an zate ah minung zaruk sawmli le pahnih a kirmi an um naón Israel miphun hrin an sinak kha an simsuak thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Puithiam Hobaiah hrin, Hakkoz hrin le Barzillai hrin pawl tla in an pupa ih thawhkehnak ca khummi cazin an hmu lo. (Barzillai hrin ih an pu in Gilead ram Barzillai hrin nunau a rak ṭhit ih a puzon ih hmin a rak lakta ruangah Barzillai hrin ti an si.) An pupa pawl zo an si, ti an theih lo ruangah annih pawl cu puithiam ah an pom thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Judah ram uktu bawi in, Urim le Thummim timi a hmang thiamtu puithiam an um hlan cu Pathian hnenih pekmi rawl thianghlim ei lo dingin Mangki bawipa in a kham a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Saltaannak ihsin a kirmi mipum zate cu thawng sawmli thawnghnih, zathum le sawmruk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Hnen-um zate nunau mipa ti loin, thawngsarih zathum sawmthum le pasarih an si. Hla saktu nunau mipa an zate ah zahnih sawmli le panga an si. Rang zasarih sawmthum le paruk, laak zahnih sawmli le panga, kalauk zali sawmthum le panga, laak fate phun thawngruk zasarih le kul an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Mi tampi in Biakinn sak saalnak ah tangka le thilri tampi an pek: Ram uktu bawi in sui cuai li, thawinak hrang kheng sawmnga, le puithiam korfual zanga le sawmthum a pek. An hrin ih hotu pawl in sui cuai sawmriat le cuai nga, le ngun cuai zariat le cuai nga an pek. Senpi pawl in sui cuai zariat le cuai nga, ngun cuai zasarih le sawmthum, le puithiam korfual sawmruk le pasarih an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Cule puithiam pawl, Levi mi pawl, biakinn kiltu pawl, hla saktu pawl, biakinn saktu pawl le Israel mi hmuahhmuah cu khawpi siseh khawte siseh khua kipah an um vivo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thla sarih thla ah Israel mi pawl cu an khua ciarah an um ṭheh. Cuih thla ni khat ni ah lungrual zetin Jerusalem khua, Tidai Kotka hmaiah an tongkhawm aw. Cule Daan cabu la dingah Ezra an fial. Ezra cu puithiam a si ih Bawipa in Israel mi hnenah Moses kut sungin a pekmi Daan thuhla a thei zetmi pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ezra in Daan cabu cu a lak ih misenpi an khawmnak hmun ahcun a feh. Cutawkah nunau, mipa le thu ciingthei hmuahhmuah an zatein an khawm-aw thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kotka kiang mualrawn ah Ezra in Daan cabu cu zinglam khawfingcah in sun tiang ringzet in a siar ih misenpi pawl cun ṭhazet in an ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuti siarnak hrangih an donmi donhleisang parah Ezra cu a ding. A vorhlam ah Mattithiah, Shema, Anaiah, Uriah, Hilkiah le Maaseiah an dingih a kehlam ah Pedaiah, Mishael, Malkhijah, Hashum, Hashbaddanah, Zekhariah le Meshullam an ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cuih donhleisang parih Ezra a din cun an zate in an mit hman ṭhep loin an zoh. Cule Daan cabu a vun on vete in an zatein an ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ezra in, “A maksak Bawipa Pathian cu thangṭhat uh!” a ti. Cutikah misenpi cun vanah an kut an phar ih, “Amen, Amen,” an tiah an let. An khuk an bil ih an hmai leilung dai tiangin kuun in Pathian an biak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule misenpi cu an tho ih an umnak ciarah an ding ih Levi mi Jeshua, Bani, Sherebiah, Jamin, Akkub, Shabbethai, Hodiah, Maaseiah, Kelita, Azariah, Jozabad, Hanan le Peliah pawl in Ezra ih siarmi Daan cu an fianter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Misenpi ih an theih theinak dingah cuih Pathian Daan an siar mi cu ṭong an let copcop.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian Daan ih tican ngaingai an theih tikah an lung a zuur ih an ṭap. Cutikah ram uktu mangki bawi Nehemiah, puithiam le Daan theitu Ezra le senpi hnenih Daan a fiangtertu Levi mi pawl in, “ Bawipa nan Pathian hrangah tuihsun cu ni thianghlim a si. Riahsia in ṭap hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nan inn ah tlung uhla rawl thawthaw ei uhla sabit thawthaw in uh. Nan rawl le nan sabit cu a nei ve lomi thawn hlawm-aw uh. Tuihsun cu Bawipa ih hrangah ni thianghlim a si, riahsia in um hlah uh. Bawipa ih lungawinak a lo pekmi cu nan cahnak a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Levi mi pawl in senpi pawl cu daite-ih um dingah an leem ih, ni thianghlim a si ruangah riahsia ih um lo dingin an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Curuangah senpi pawl cu inn ah an tlung ih lungawi zetin an ei an in ih an rualpi pawl thawn an hlawm-aw; an hnenih an lehsakmi Daan ih tican an theih fiang ruangah aipuang zetin an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thaisun ah an hrin ciarih hotu pawl cu puithiam pawl le Levi mi pawl thawn Daan ih tican ngaingai zir dingah Ezra hnenah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Moses hmang in Israel mi hnenih Bawipa in a pekmi Daan sungah cun Puanthlam Puai sung cu a laangte ih deu tuah tahratin cuih deu sungih um dingah Israel mi hnenih thupekmi a um kha an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Curuangah Jerusalem le khuadang hmuahhmuah ah hiti in thu an pek: “Tlangpar ah feh uhla Daan sungih thupekmi a um vekin, deu saknak ah olif hnge, far hnge, lenhmui hnge, tum hnah pawl le hnah-nei thing dangdang tla va la uh,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Senpi pawl cu an feh ih deu saknak ah thinghnge pawl an lak ih an inn tlunih diphun rawn parah, an tual le Biakinn tual ah siseh, Tidai Kotka le Efraim Kotka kiangih senpi tlannak mualrawn tla ah siseh, deu cu an sak ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saltaannak in a ra kirmi hmuahhmuah in deu cu an sak ih a sungah cun an um. Himi cu Nun ih fapa Joshua san hnu ahcun an tuah hmaisa bikmi a si. An zatein lungawi aipuang in an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An puai tuah ni khat ni in a netnak ni tiang nitinte Pathian ih Daan cu an siar. Ni sarih sung puai an tuah ih, Daan pekmi sungih a um vekin niriatnak ni ah an puai an ṭiak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih thla ni kul hluanli ni ah Israel mi pawl cu hmunkhat ah an tong-aw khawm ih an sualsirnak langternak ah rawl an ul; buri puan an sin ih an lu ah leivut an phulh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ramdang mi thawn rawi-aw loin hlimphir in an um. Cule an ding ih anmah le an pupa pawl ih sualnak cu an phuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nazi pathum sung Bawipa an Pathian ih Daan an siarmi cu an ngai ih cuih hnu nazi pathum sung an sual phuangin Bawipa an Pathian an biak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Levi mi pawl hrangah donhleisang an don ih cuih parah Jeshua, Bani, Kadmiel, Shebaniah, Bunni, Sherebiah, Bani le Khenani pawl an ding ih ringzet in Bawipa an Pathian ih hmin an ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Levi mi Jeshua, Kadmiel, Bani, Hashabneiah, Sherebiah, Hodiah, Shebaniah, le Pethahiah in biak kawhnak ah hiti in an saal: “Ding uhla Bawipa nan Pathian cu thangṭhat uh, Kumkhua in kumkhua tiang amah cu thangṭhat uh, A hmin sunglawi cu mikip in thangṭhat uh, Milai thangṭhatnak cu a kim lo naón mi kipin thangṭhat uh,” an ti. Cule Israel pawl cu hiti in thla an cam:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Maw Bawipa , nangmah lawng Bawipa na si, Van le arsi pawl khi nangmah in na tuah. Nangmah in lei le tipi le a sung ummi hmuahhmuah na tuah ṭheh. Ziang hmuahhmuah nunnak na pek, Van ih a ummi hmuahhmuah in nangmah cu kuun in an lo bia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa Pathian, nangmah in Abram na hril, Babilon ram Ur khua in na ko; A hmin cu Abraham ah na thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rinsan tlak ih na hmuh ruangah, Amah thawn thukamnak na tuah. Kanaan ram pek dingah thu na kam, Hit mi, Amor mi le Perez mi pawl Jebus mi le Girgash mi ram cu; A tesinfa pawl umnak ramah na ti. Na thukamnak bangin na kimter, A dingfel mi na si ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Izipt ramih kan pupa pawl an tuar zia cu na hmu, Tipi Sen ah bomnak an lo dil mi cu na thei;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Faro dodal in khawruahhar mangbangza na tuah, A kuthnuai bawi pawl le a ram minung pawl dodal in, Na minung pawl an hrem tuk hai ruangah. Culai ah na rak neh ih, Atu khal ah na hmin a thang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tipi satcat in na minung hrang lamzin na tuah, Leiro par in na hruai hai. A duumtu pawl cu tipi thuuk sungah an tla, Tipisuar lakih lungto pil bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sun ah khawdur in na hruai hai, Zan ah an lamzin cu meifar na van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sinai Tlang parah van ihsin na rung ṭum tikah, Cutawkah na minung pawl hnenah na ṭong, An hnenah daan ṭha le thudik zirhnak na pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sabbath ni thiangter dingah na zirh ih, Na siahhlawh Moses hnenin na daan pawl na pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“An ril a rawn tikah van ihsin sang na run thlak, An ti a haal tikah lungpi sungin an in ding tidai na suahter. An thlennak ding ram cu luah dingah na sim, An hnenih pek dingih na tiam cia mi ram cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asinain kan pupa pawl cu an hngal ih an lung a ruh, Na thupekmi thlun an duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na thu an thlun duh lo ih na thil tuahmi an hngilh ṭheh; Mangbangza na tuah mi pawl cu an ciing nawn lo. An hngalnak thawn hotu an hril, Izipt saltaannak ih kirpi dingah. Asinain nang cu mi ngaithiamtu Lainatu Pathian na si, Zaangfahnak le duhdawtnak na nei, Na thinheng a fuung ngaingai. Na thinpemnak cu a tum ngaingai, Na dungtun siang hai lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cawcang pian in khawzing lem an siam, Izipt ram ihsin in suahtu pathian a si an ti; Bawipa , ziangtlukin so an lo hmuhsuam hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nelrawn ahcun na hnongta hai lo, Na zaangfahnak a tum ruangah. Khawdur le meisa cu na lak kir siang lo, Sunzan in an lam hmuhtu pawl cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na ṭhat ruangah an tuah ding mi na sim, Manna in na cawm hai, An in dingah tidai na pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kum sawmli sung nelrawn ah, An ṭulmi hmuahhmuah na pek ṭheh, An hnipuan a ṭet dah lo, An ke tla naa in a thling dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ram tampi le miphun tampi na nehter, An ram kiangkap ih ram pawl cu. Sihon ukmi Heshbon ram an neh, Og Siangpahrang a ṭuannak Bashan ram tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Van arsi zat in tesinfa na pek, Ram na nehter ih na luahter; An pupa hnenih na tiam ciami an luah dingmi ram cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kanaan ram cu an lak; A rak ummi pawl na neh ṭheh; Na minung pawl hnenah an duhmi tuah theinak huham na pek, Kanaan ram Siangpahrang pawl le an minung pawl parah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na minung pawl cun kulh mi khawpi pawl an lak, Ram ṭha le tikhur laih cia tla, Sumpai in a khat mi inn pawl, Olif kung, thingrah kung le sabit hmuan pawl thawn. An duhzat in an ei ih an thau, Na pekmi thilṭha lakah an nuam ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Cu cingin na minung pawl cu ral an tho, Na thu an thlun duh lo, Na Daan pekmi an dungtun. Na thu zirhtu profet pawl an that, Ralrinnak petu le na hnen ra kir dingih thusimtu pawl cu. An lo hmuhsuam hi a nasa ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Curuangah an ral kut sungah na thlenter ih, Annih in an uk ih an hrem hai. An vansaan tikah na bomnak duh ah an lo ko, Van in an aunak aw na run thei. Na mi zaangfahnak a tum ruangah, An hnenah hotu pawl na run thlah, An ral kut sung in runtu dingah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hnangamnak an hmuh tikah cun an sual sal, An ral kut sungah na thlenter sal. Asinain an sual an siirih nunnak an lo dil tikah, Van ihsin na run thei ih, Avei siarcawk lo na run hai a si; Na zaangfahnak a tum ruangah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na thupekmi thlun dingah ralrinnak na pek, Asinain puarthau in na daan cu an hnong; Na Daan thlun cu nunnak lamzin a si ko naón! Lungruh le thulungkhen nei in an thlun duh talo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kumkhat hnu kum khat lungsau in ralrinnak na pek hai, Na profet pawl in an sim rero nan, Na minung pawl cu an hna a seet. Curuangah na minung pawl cu Miphun dang pawl in an uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Sikhalsehla na zaangfahnak a tum ruangah, Na hnong loih na siatsuah hai lo; Nang cu zaangfahnak le thinpemnak neitu Pathian na si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Maw Pathian, Ziangkimtithei Pathian, ṭihnungza le ziangzongza tuah theitu Pathian; Na thukam mi cu famkimzet in na kimter ṭheh. Assiria Siangpahrang pawl ih in hrem thokin, Tuihsun tiang kan tuar mi hi, Thu-tenau ah in ruahsak hram hlah aw. Kan siangpahrang pawl le kan hotu pawl, Kan puithiam le kan profet pawl, Kan pupa pawl le kan mi senpi pawl ih an tuarmi, Hi tluk kan tuarmi hi run theisak hramhram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />In hrem ṭheu hi na dik ko, hrem tlak kan si; Nang cu rintlak na si, kannih kan sual a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kan pupa le kan siangpahrang pawl thokin, Kan hotu pawl le kan puithiam pawl tla in Na Daan cu an thlun lo a si. Na thupekmi le na ralrin pekmi cu, An ngai duh hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Na thlawsuah peknak thawngin Siangpahrang in na minung an uk. Na pekmi ramkau le ramṭha sung an um lai ahcun. Asinain sualnak sungin an kir loih Na hna cu an ṭuan lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Atu ahcun in pekmi ram sungah sal ah kan cang, Ei in ding in petu hih ramṭha sungah hin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kan ram sungin a suak mi hmuahhmuah cu, Siangpahrang hnenah a feh ṭheh; Kan sual ruangah kan tlunih na retmi bawi hnenah cun. Kanmah siseh, kan rannung siseh, an duhduh in in tuah, Kan van a sang ngaingai,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kan parih thil a cangmi pawl ruangah hin, kannih Israel mi pawl hin atu-ah ca ngan in lungkimnak cakhen kan tuah ih kan hotu pawl, kan Levi mi pawl le kan puithiam pawl in a parah an hmin an khen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hmaisa bikih a hmin ngantu cu ram uktu mangki bawi, Hakaliah ih fapa Nehemiah a si; cuih hnuah Zedekiah in a hmin a ngan. Hmin ngantu midang pawl cu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Puithiam pawl: Seraiah, Azariah, Jeremiah, Pashhur, Amariah, Malkhijah, Hattush, Shebaniah, Malluk, Harim, Meremoth, Obadiah, Daniel, Ginnethon, Baruk, Meshullam, Abijah, Mijamin, Maaziah, Bilgai, le Shemaiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Levi mi pawl: Azaniah ih fapa Jeshua, Henadad hrin in Binnui, Kadmiel, Shebaniah, Hodiah, Kelita, Pelaiah, Hanan, Mika, Rehob, Hashabiah, Zakkur, Sherebiah, Shebaniah, Hodiah, Bani le Beninu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Misenpi hotu pawl: Parosh, Pahath Moab, Elam, Zattu, Bani, Bunni, Azgad, Bebai, Adonijah, Bigvai, Adin, Ater, Hezekiah, Azzur, Hodiah, Hashum, Bezai, Harif, Anathoth, Nebai, Magpiash, Meshullam, Hezir, Meshezabel, Zadok, Jaddua, Pelatiah, Hanan, Anaiah, Hoshea, Hananiah, Hasshub, Hallohesh, Pilha, Shobek, Rehum, Hashabnah, Maaseiah, Ahiah, Hanan, Anan, Malluk, Harim le Baanah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kannih Israel mi, puithiam pawl, Levi mi pawl, biakinn kiltu pawl, biakinn ih hla satu pawl, biakinn kilkhawitu pawl le a dangdang tla in, Pathian pekmi Daan thlun in kan ram sungih a ummi miphun dang pawl thawn thleidang aw in hlimphir teih kan um hnuah, kan nupi pawl, kan fanu kan fapa, le thuciing thei kan faate pawl le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />in hotu kan unau pawl thawn hmunkhat ah kutsih in, hi thukamnak kan bal asile siatcamnak tuar dingah Moses kutin Pathian ih in pekmi Daan thlun in kan Pathian ih thukham hmuahhmuah cu kan ngai pei ih, a daan le a thupekmi pawl ralringte in kan thlun ding tiah hi thukamnak cu kan tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kan ram sungih a ummi miphun dang pawl thawn ṭhit awknak kan tuah lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Sabbath ni ah siseh, ni dang ni thianghlim ni ah siseh, rawl le a dang thilri pawl in rak zorh khalle kan lei lo pei. Kum sarih kum a kimtinte in kan leiram cu kan thlo lo pei ih cuih kum ahcun leiba hmuahhmuah kan olh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kumtinte kan Pathian ih Biakinn hnaṭuannak hrangah tangka fangkhat ih ṭhenthum ṭhen ṭhenkhat kan pek ringring pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kan Bawipa Biakinn ih Pathian kan biaknak hrangah sangreu thianghlim, nitin thlairawl thawinak pekmi, nitin mei-ur thawinak pekmi rannung, Sabbath ni, Thlathar Puai le puai dangdang hrang thawinak thianghlim pawl, thawinak thianghlim dangdang hrang le Israel sualthlah thawinak hrangah a ṭulmi hmuahhmuah kan pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kannih misenpi pawl, puithiam pawl le Levi mi pawl in, Daan sungih a um bangtuk in, Bawipa kan Pathian hnenih mei-ur thawinak kan pek tikah zo hrin in ziangtikah zanthing a keng ding ti theihfiangnak ah kumtinten camcawhfung kan zuuk pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kumtinte in kan rawl a cu hmaisa bik le kan thingkung ih a rah hmaisa bik cu Biakinn ah kan pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Daan sungih a um bangtuk in Pathian Biakinn ih a ṭuantu puithiam pawl hnenah, Pathian hnenih pek dingah kan fapa upa bik, kan caw fatir, kan tuu le kan me fatir pawl cu kan pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Pathian Biakinn ah le Biakinn ih hnaṭuantu puithiam pawl hnenah, kumtinte kan lak hmaisa bik fang ih tuahmi sangphut le sabitti, olif hriak, le a dang kan neihmi thingrah a phunphun kan pek pei. Lo kan thlawhnak kan lo ihsin, thawhlawm a khawmtu Levi mi pawl hnenah, kan khua kan ram sungin a suakmi rawl ṭhenhra ih ṭhenkhat cu kan pek pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Aaron tesinfa puithiam pawl cu thawhlawm khawm tikah Levi mi pawl hnenah an tel ve pei ih, Levi mi pawl in an khawm ciami thawhlawm hmuahhmuah sungin ṭhenhra ih ṭhenkhat cu Biakinn hnaṭuannak hrangah Biakinn rawlretnak khaan ah an ret pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Rawl, sabitti le olif hriak an pekmi pawl cu Israel mi le Levi mi pawl in Biakinn beelkheng an retnak khaan, Biakinn hnaṭuantu puithiam pawl, Biakinn kiltu pawl le Biakinn ih hla satu pawl umnak khaan ah an ret pei. Kan Pathian ih Biakinn cu kan daithlan lo pei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hotu pawl cu Jerusalem khawpi ah an um; misenpi sungin innsang pahra sungah pakhat cu Jerusalem ih um dingah camcawhfung an zuuk ih, a dang hmuahhmuah cu khawdang le khawte sungah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem khawsungah keimah ka um pei tiah lungkimte ih a ti theitu pawl cu misenpi pawl in an lawm ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel misenpi, puithiam pawl, Levi mi pawl, Biakinn saktu pawl le Solomon hnen-um pawl ih tesinfa pawl cu khua dang le khawte sungah anmah ih leiram ciarah an um. Judah peng sungin Jerusalem ih a ummi upa hminthang deuh pawl cu a tanglam pawl hi an si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judah hrin sungin Jerusalem ih a ummi pawl: Uzziah ih fapa le Zekhariah ih tu Athaiah. A pupa dang pawl cu Amariah, Shefatiah le Mahalalel an si ih Judah ih fapa Perez ih tesinfa an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Baruk fapa le Kolhozeh ih tu Maaseiah. A pupa dang pawl cu Hazaiah, Adaiah, Joiarib le Zekhariah an si ih Judah ih fapa Shelah ih tefa sin an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Perez ih tesinfa sungin mi hminthang zali sawmruk le pariat Jerusalem ah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Benjamin hrin sungin Jerusalem ih a ummi pawl: Meshullam ih fapa le Joed ih tu Sallu. A pupa dang pawl cu Pedaiah, Kolaiah, Maaseiah, Ithiel le Jeshaiah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sallu sungkhat Gabbai le Sallai. An zate-ah Benjamin innsang sungin zakua kul hluanriat Jerusalem ah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zikhri ih fapa Joel cu an hotu a si ih Hassenuah ih fapa Judah cu Jerusalem khawsung ih bawi upa bik sangtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem ih a ummi Puithiam pawl: Joiarib ih fapa Jedaiah le Jakhin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hilkiah ih fapa le Meshullam ih tu Seraiah. A pupa dang pawl cu Zadok, Meraioth le Puithiam Sang Ahitub an si. Ahitub cu Biakinn zohtu upa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An zate-ah an hrin sungin zariat le kul hluanhnih cu Biakinn ih hnaṭuantu an si. Jeroham ih fapa le Pelaliah ih tu Adaiah. A pupa dang pawl cu Amzi, Zekhariah, Pashhur le Malkhijah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An zate-ah an hrin sungin zahnih sawmli le pahnih cu innsang hotu pawl an si. Azarel ih fapa le Ahzai ih tu Amashsai. A pupa dang pawl cu Meshillemoth le Immer an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An hrin sungin za le kul hluanriat cu ralkap hminthangzet an si. An hrin sungih upa Zabdiel cu an hotu a si ih Haggedolim fapa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jerusalem ih a ummi Levi mi pawl: Hasshub ih fapa le Azrikam ih tu Shemaiah. A pupa dang pawl cu Hashabiah le Bunni an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Biakinn lengah hnaṭuan neitu Levi mi hminthang Shabbethai le Jozabad.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mika ih fapa le Asaf tesinfa Zabdi ih fapa sin Mattaniah; lungawi thlacamnak hla an sak tikah Mattaniah cu hla hruaitu a si. Mattaniah bawmtu Bakbukiah. Shammua ih fapa le Jeduthun tefa sin Galal ih fapa sin Abda.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An zate-ah Jerusalem khua thianghlim sungah Levi mi zahnih sawmriat le pali an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Biakinn kiltu Jerusalem ih a ummi: Akkub, Talmon, le a sungkhat pawl za le sawmsarih le pahnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A dang Israel mi pawl, puithiam le Levi mi dangdang pawl cu Judah ramsung khawpi le khawte sungah anmah ih leiram ciarah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Biakinn tuamhlawmtu pawl cu Jerusalem khua Ofel vengah an um ih an hotu cu Ziha le Gishpa an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jerusalem ih a ummi Levi mi pawl hotu cu Bani ih fapa le Hashabiah ih tu Uzzi a si. A pupa dang pawl cu Mattaniah le Mika an si ih Asaf hrin an si. Asaf hrin pawl cu Biakinn khawm tikah hla satu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hrinkhat hnu hrinkhat nitinte Biakinn ih hlasak cu a haha teih sawng aw dingah Siangpahrang ih thupeknak a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Judah phun, Zerah hrin, Meshezabel ih fapa Pethahiah cu Persia siangpahrang zungah Israel mi pawl ih palai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi tampi cu an lothlawhnak kiangih khua ah an um. Judah hrin pawl cu Kiriath Arba khua, Dibon leh Jekabzeel khua le an kiangkap ih khawte pawl ah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cule Jeshua khua, Moladah khua, Bethpelet khua le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hazarshual khua tla ah an um ih Beersheba khua le a kiangkap khawte pawl ah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ziklag khua le Mekonah khua le a kiangkap khawte ah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Enrimmon khua, Zorah khua, Jarmuth khua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zanoah khua, Adullam khua le an kiangkap khawte pawl ah an um. Lakhish khua le a kiangih an thlawh mi lo ah le, Azekah le a kiangih khawte pawl ah an um. Cuticun Judah mi pawl cu thlanglam Beersheba ihsin saklam Jerusalem khua kiang Hinnom Phairawn tiang, khua kipah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cun Benjamin hrin pawl cu Geba khua, Mikmash khua, Ai khua, Bethel khua le a kiangkap khawte ah le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Anathoth khua, Nob khua, Ananiah khua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hazor khua, Ramah khua, Gittaim khua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hadid khua, Zeboiim khua, Neballat khua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lod khua, Ono khua le Zungthiam Phairawn ah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Judah ram sungih a rak ummi Levi mi hrekkhat pawl cu Benjamin mi pawl thawn hmunkhatah an umter.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babilon saltaannak ihsin Shealtiel ih fapa Zerubbabel le Puithiam Sang Joshua thawn a ra kirmi puithiam le Levi mi pawl cu a tanglam pawl hi an si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Puithiam pawl: Seraiah, Jeremiah, Ezra, Amariah, Malluk, Hattush, Shekaniah, Rehum, Meremoth, Iddo, Ginnethoi, Abijah, Mijamin, Maadiah, Bilgah, Shemaiah, Joiarib, Jedaiah, Sallu, Amok, Hilkiah le Jedaiah. Hi pawl cu Joshua sanih an unau puithiam pawl lakah hotu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Levi mi pawl: Lungawinak hla an sak tikah a tanglam pawl cu hla hruaitu an si: Jeshua, Binnui, Kadmiel, Sherebiah, Judah le Mattaniah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bakbukiah le Unno cu an unau Levi mi pawl thawn hlarem sawn-awtu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Joshua cu Joiakim ih pa a si; Joiakim cu Eliashib ih pa a si; Eliashib cu Joiada ih pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Joiada cu Jonathan ih pa a si; Jonathan cu Jaddua ih pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Puithiam Sang Joiakim sanah a tanglam pawl hi puithiam hrin ih hotu pawl an si: Seraiah hrin ah Meraiah, Jeremiah hrin ah Hananiah, Ezra hrin ah Meshullam, Amariah hrin ah Jehohanan, Mallukhi hrin ah Jonathan, Shebaniah hrin ah Josef, Harim hrin ah Adna, Meroioth hrin ah Helkai, Iddo hrin ah Zekhariah, Ginnethon hrin ah Meshullam, Abijah hrin ah Zikhri, Miniamin hrin ah … Moadiah hrin ah Piltai, Bilgah hrin ah Shammua, Shemaiah hrin ah Jehonathan, Joiarib hrin ah Mattenai, Jedaiah hrin ah Uzzi, Sallai hrin ah Kallai, Amok hrin ah Eber, Hilkiah hrin ah Hashabiah, Jedaiah hrin ah Nethanel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Puithiam Sang Eliashib, Joiada, Johanan le Jaddua pawl sanah Levi mi innsang pawl le puithiam innsang pawl hotu cazin cu ṭhatein an ret. Cuih cazin cu Darias in Persia siangpahrang a ṭuan laiah an tuah ṭheh mi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Levi mi innsang hotu pawl ih cazin cu Eliashib ih tu Johanan san tiang siangpahrang thu hminsinnak cabu sungah an khum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Levi mi pawl cu Hashabiah, Sherebiah, Jeshua, Binnui le Kadmiel ho in bu tampi ah an ṭhen. Pathian ih minung, siangpahrang David ih thupeknak vekin ṭum khatah bu hnih bu hnih in a sawn-aw in Pathian an thangṭhat ih Pathian hnenah lungawinak an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Biakinn kotka pawl kiangih thilri retnak inn pawl kiltu cu a tanglam pawl hi an si: Mattaniah, Bakbukiah, Obadiah, Meshullam, Talmon le Akkub.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Himi pawl cu Joshua fapa le Jehozadak ih tu Joiakim san le ram uk Mangki bawi Nehemiah san le Daan thei zettu le puithiam Ezra san ih a ummi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerusalem khawpi phardawl cu Pathian hnenih an hlan tikah dar sumsel, ṭingṭang le tingrisit tum thawn mi hmuahhmuah in lungawinak hla an sak ih lungawi aipuang in puai ih an tel thei ciarnak dingah Levi mi pawl cu an umnak kipin Jerusalem ah an ko ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Levi mi hla satu pawl cu an umnak hmun ihsin le Jerusalem kiangkap Netofah kiangkap khua pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Beth Gilgal, Geba le Azmaveth khua pawl in an rasuak khawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Puithiam le Levi mi pawl cun anmah thianhlimnak thawinak le misenpi hrang thawinak, kotka pawl le khawpi phardawl thianhlim thawinak cu an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cule Judah mi hotu upa pawl cu phardawl parah cun ka kaiter hai ih Pathian hnenah lungawi thusim phah ih khawpi veltu dingah bu tum pipi bu hnih ah ka ṭhen. Bu khat cu phardawl parah cun vorhlam ihsin Hnawm Kotka lamah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hla saktu pawl ih dungin Hoshaiah a feh ih amah cu Judah mi hotu a hrekin an thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cuih dungah a tanglam ih puithiam pawl in tawtawrawt tum phah in an thlun. Hmaisa bik ah Azariah, Ezra, Meshullam, Judah, Benjamin, Shemaiah le Jeremiah an si. A sangtu ah Jonathan ih fapa le Shemaiah ih tu Zekhariah a si. (A pupa pawl cu Mattaniah, Mikaiah le Zakkur an si ih Asaf hrin an si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zekhariah cu a hrinpi unau pawl: Shemaiah, Azarel, Milalai, Gilalai, Maai, Nethanel, Judah le Hanani pawl in an thlun ih an zatein Pathian ih minung Siangpahrang David ih a rak tummi awnmawi vek an keng ciar. Hi pawl cu an feh tikah Daan thiam Ezra in hmai a ṭhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cerhti Kotka an thlen in David Khawpi ih hung fehnak kailawn an kai ih David Siangpahrang inn an lan hnuah khawpi nisuahnak lam Tidai Kotka ih phardawl ahcun an ra thleng sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Lungawi thusimtu bu dang pakhat cu phardawl parah cun kehlam ah an feh ih keimah le mi ṭhenkhat in kan thlun. Kan feh ih Meikhu suahnak Innsangpi timi kan lan ih Phar Kaupi timi kan thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cutawkin Efraim Kotka, Jeshanah Kotka, Nga Kotka, Hananel donhleisang le Zakhat donhleisang kan lan ih Tuu Kotka kan thlen hnuah Ralveng Kotka ah kan netter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cuticun an bu hnih in Pathian thangṭhat phah in Biakinn kiang an thleng. Ka hnenih a fehmi hotu pawl hlei ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />tawtawrawt tum phah in puithiam Eliakim, Maaseiah, Miniamin, Mikaiah, Elioenai, Zekhariah le Hananiah pawl an tel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Cule hla satu pawl ah Jezrahiah ho in Maaseiah, Shemaiah, Eleazar, Uzzi, Jehohanan, Malkhijah, Elam le Ezer pawl an tel ih an aw neih patawp in hla an sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cuih ni ahcun thawinak tampi an pe ih lungawinak thawn an khat, ziangahtile Pathian in lungawizet dingin a tuah hai. Cuih lungawinak puai ahcun nunau le nauhak pawl tla an tel ih an thawmvang cu hlapi tiang a thang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Culai ahcun an rawl hmaisa bik a cu mi le an thingrah kumtinte a rah hmaisa bik pawl le thawhlawm, ṭhenhra ṭhenkhat le a dangdang Biakinn hrangih an pekmi pawl retnak inn pawl kiltu dingah mi an ret. Hi an retmi pawl cun thilri retnak inn an kil ih tlunah, Daan sungih a um vekin puithiam pawl le Levi mi pawl hrangih an pek mi pawl cu khawpi kiangih a ummi lo ihsin an va khawm. Judah mi hmuahhmuah cu puithiam le Levi mi pawl parah an lung a awi ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ziangahtile Pathian ih thupekmi vekin thil an tuah ih felzetin thianhlim thawinak tla an tuah a si. Cule biakinn hla satu pawl le biakinn kiltu pawl khalin siangpahrang David le a fapa Solomon ih thupekmi vekin, an hnaṭuan cu feltein an ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hlanlai ih siangpahrang David le hlathiam Asaf san lai ihsin hla satu pawl cu thangṭhatnak hla sak tikah le Pathian hnenih lungawi thusim tikah mi hotu an si ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Zerubbabel san le Nehemiah san khalah Biakinn hla satu pawl le biakinn kiltu pawl pumcawmnak hrangah cun Israel mi pawl in nitinte thawhlawm an pe ringring a si. Senpi pawl in thawinak thianghlim cu Levi mi pawl hnenah an pek ih Levi mi pawl in an pek ding zat cu Aaron ih tesinfa puithiam pawl hrangah an pe ve.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih caanah Moses Daan cu ring zetin misenpi hnenah an siar ih an siar mi caang khat ah, Ammon mi le Moab mi pawl cu ziangtik khalah Pathian ih minung pawl lakah an tel thei lo pei, timi an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ziangah cutin a um tile, Israel mi pawl Izipt ram ihsin an rak suah laiah Ammon mi le Moab mi pawl in in ei ding ti le rawl an rak pek lo ruangah a si. In ei ding ti le rawl an pek lo lawng si loin, Israel mi pawl camsiat dingah Balaam hnen riangri ah paisa an rak pek; asinain cuih camsiatnak cu kan Pathian in thlawsuahnak ah an hrangah a canter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel misenpi in cuih Daan siarmi cu an theih tikah anmah sung ihsin ramdang mi pawl cu an dawi ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Biakinn thilri retnak khaan pawl a uktu puithiam Eliashib le Tobiah cu caan reipi rualrem zetin an rak um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Curuangah Tobiah cu khaan tumpi pakhat a luahter; cuih khaan cu thawinak hrangih pekmi sangphut le rimhmui; Biakinn ih hmanmi thilri; puithiam pawl hrangih thawinak pek mi pawl; Levi mi pawl hnenih pek mi thawhlawm, ṭhenhra ṭhenkhat, le sabit le olif siti pawl, biakinn hla satu le biakinn kiltu pawl hrangih an pekmi hmuahhmuah retnak ah timi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuti a si laiah cun Jerusalem khua ah ka um lo; Artakzaksis in Babilon Siangpahrang a ṭuannak kum sawmthum le kum hnih kum ah amah tong ding le thuhla than dingah ka feh. Malte a rei hnuah amah ih lungkimnak in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem khua ah ka ra kir. Cule Biakinn thilri retnak khaan pakhat Eliashib in Tobiah a hmanter ti ka hmuh tikah ka thin a heng ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thinheng in Tobiah ih thilri hmuahhmuah cu ka hlon ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun thilri retnak khaan pawl cu thianhlim thawinak tuah dingah le a sungah Biakinn thilri, thawinak sangphut le rimhmui pawl ret dingah thu ka pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuih tlunah Levi mi pawl le Biakinn hla satu pawl cu misenpi pawl in rawl ei khop an pek thei lo ruangah Jerusalem an suahsan ih an lo ciarah an tlung thluh ti ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah hotu bawi pawl cu, “Ziangah so Bawipa ih Biakinn cu nan daithlan ih nan ṭhinter?” tiah ka mawhthluk hai. Levi mi le hla satu pawl cu ka ko sal ih an hnaṭuan cu ka ṭuanter sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule Israel mi pawl in an thawhlawm rawl, sabitti le olif hriak pawl cu Biakinn thilri retnak khaanah an rak keng sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tanglam mi pawl cu thilri retnak khaan kiltu ah ka ret: puithiam Shelemiah, Daan thiamtu Zadok le Levi mi Pedaiah. Zakkur ih fapa le Mattaniah ih tu Hanan cu anmah bawmtu ah ka ret. Himi pawl cu hnaṭuantu dang an unau hnenah ti rawl ṭhatein an zem ding, tiih ka rinsan mi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Maw ka Pathian, nangmah biaknak le na Biakinn hrangih hi thil ka tuah mi hmuahhmuah hi hngilh hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Culai ah Judah mi pawl in Sabbath ni ah sabit rah an rial rero kha ka hmu. Midang tla an sangphut, an sabitti le sabit rah, an theipi rah, le thil dangdang pawl an laak parah suangin Jerusalem ih an phurh rero kha ka hmu. Sabbath ni ahcun zianghman zuar lo dingin ralrinnak ka pek hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule ṭai-ar khua mi Jerusalem ih a ummi pawl in Sabbath ni ah kan milai pawl hnenih zuar dingah nga le thildang a phunphun an run phur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah mi hotu pawl cu ka kawk ih, “Thil ṭha lo nan tuah mi hi zohhnik uh! Sabbath ni nan buar a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hi vek hi nan pupa pawl in an tuah ruangah sokhaw Pathian ih hremnak an tuar ih hi khawpi tla siatsuah thluh a rak si! Cucingin Sabbath ni cu nan borhhlawhter ih Israel parah Pathian thinhengnak nan thlenter sinsin,” tiah ka mawhthluk hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cuti a si ruangah zanlam tikcu a thlen ih Sabbath ni a thok tinte in khua kotka pawl cu khar dingah le acuih Sabbath ni a cem hlan lo kotka cu on lo dingin thu ka pek. Sabbath ni ahcun khawsungah thilri zianghman luhter lo dingin ka minung hrekkhat pawl cu kotka pawl ka kilter fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Voihnih voikhat cu dawrtuahtu thil a phunphun zuartu pawl cu khawpi hauhruang lengah tlawngkai ni nga zanvaarte an riak ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cupawl hnenah cun, “Thaizing tiang hngak duh hlah uh, nan hngak lak ding. Nan zuar tum thotho asile napi in ka lo tuah ding,” tiah ralrinnak ka pek. Cuih hnu cun Sabbath ni ah an rasal nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cule Levi mi pawl cu anmah thianhlimnak tuah dingah le Sabbath ni thianghlim teih ul dingah kotka cu ṭhatein nan kil pei, tiah thu ka pek. Maw ka Pathian, hi thil ka tuah mi hmuahhmuah hi hngilh hram hlah awla na duhdawtnak a tum vekin na zaangfahnak cu ka hnenah thlenter hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Culai ahcun Judah mi mipa tampi in miphun dang nunau Ashdod mi, Ammon mi le Moab mi pawl an ṭhi ti ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An hrinmi an faate a hrek pawl cu Ashdod ṭong le ṭong dangdang an ṭong ih kan ṭong an thiam nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cuih mipa pawl cu ka kawk ih ka cam ka riam hai. Ka vuak ka velh hai ih an sam tla ka phawisak. Cule anmah siseh, an faate pawl siseh, miphun dang pawl ih fanu ṭhi nawn lo ding le an fapa pawl pasal nawn lo dingah Pathian hmin saal in siatcam thukamnak ka tuahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An hnenah, “Siangpahrang Solomon sualtertu cu ramdang nunau an si. Amah cu miphun dang siangpahrang hmuahhmuah hnakin a tum sawn. Pathian in amah cu a duhdawt ih Israel mi zate tlunah Siangpahrang ah a tuah. Asinain cuih sualnak sungah a tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cutiin maw nan ziaza ṭha lo cu thlun in miphun dang nunau nan ṭhit dingih nan Pathian ih thupekmi cu thlun loin kan um ve ding?” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Puithiam Sang Eliashib ih fapa cu Joiada a si. Asinain Joiada fapa pakhat in Beth Horon khuami Sanballat fanu a ṭhi. Curuangah amah Joiada cu Jerusalem ihsin ka dawi suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Maw ka Pathian, himi pawl in puithiam hnaṭuan le, puithiam le Levi mi pawl thawn thukamnak na tuahmi an buar zia hi ciing ringring hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cun senpi pawl cu an lakah mi phundangta zianghman um hrimhrim lo dingin thianfainak ka tuahter thluh. Puithiam le Levi mi pawl in an hnaṭuan theifel dingah daan pawl ka tuahsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tikcu khiah mi kim tikih thawinak pekmi pawl urnak dingah zanthing le rawlthar le thingrah thar thawinak hrangih pek dingmi pawl khal ka ngaihtuah sak. Maw ka Pathian, hipawl hi a ṭha lamin i run thei hram aw.
  </para>
</usx>
